--- a/tests/gateway/conftest.py
+++ b/tests/gateway/conftest.py
@@ -12,11 +12,32 @@ ImportError fallback, causing 30+ downstream test failures wherever
 
 Individual test files may still call their own ``_ensure_telegram_mock``
